<h2>The numbers</h2>
<p>According to the organiser's final report [1], 1,135 exhibitors from 40 countries and regions took part, compared with 1,066 in 2024. About 56 per cent of them came from outside Germany. Visitors numbered about 35,000 from 115 countries and regions, against 33,386 in 2024, and roughly 40 per cent were international. India appears among the top ten exhibitor countries, alongside Germany, China, the United States, Italy and others. The organiser's figures page [2] gives the exact visitor count as 35,033 and says 99 per cent were trade visitors.</p>
