        'slug' => 'iso-15189-2022-transition-medical-laboratories',
        'excerpt' => 'ILAC allowed three years for medical labs to move to ISO 15189:2022. NABL has since issued guidance for medical laboratories, and its 2026 notices show continued activity.',
